ebe estar vacío\"\n  response response_statement_audit_strength_range_ru\n    intent statement_audit_strength_range\n    language ru\n    text \"должно находиться между 0 и 1\"\n  response response_statement_audit_strength_range_hi\n    intent statement_audit_strength_range\n    language hi\n    text \"0 और 1 के बीच होना चाहिए\"\n  response response_statement_audit_strength_range_zh\n    intent statement_audit_strength_range\n    language zh\n    text \"必须在 0 到 1 之间\"\n  response response_statement_audit_strength_range_es\n    intent statement_audit_strength_range\n    language es\n    text \"debe estar entre 0 y 1\"\n  response response_statement_audit_selector_exclusive_ru\n    intent statement_audit_selector_exclusive\n    language ru\n    text \"следует использовать поля statement или claim, но не оба одновременно\"\n  response response_statement_audit_selector_exclusive_hi\n    intent statement_audit_selector_exclusive\n    language hi\n    text \"statement या claim फ़ील्ड में से किसी एक का उपयोग होना चाहिए, दोनों का नहीं\"\n  response response_statement_audit_selector_exclusive_zh\n    intent statement_audit_selector_exclusive\n    language zh\n    text \"必须使用 statement 字段或 claim 字段，不能同时使用两者\"\n  response response_statement_audit_selector_exclusive_es\n    intent statement_audit_selector_exclusive\n    language es\n    text \"debe usar los campos statement o claim, pero no ambos\"\n  response response_statement_audit_claim_subject_ru\n    intent statement_audit_claim_subject\n    language ru\n    text \"для claim требуется subject\"\n  response response_statement_audit_claim_subject_hi\n    intent statement_audit_claim_subject\n    language hi\n    text \"claim के लिए subject आवश्यक है\"\n  response response_statement_audit_claim_subject_zh\n    intent statement_audit_claim_subject\n    language zh\n    text \"claim 需要 subject\"\n  response response_statement_audit_claim_subject_es\n    intent statement_audit_claim_subject\n    language es\n    text \"claim re